eAudio driver was passing nullptr as the buffer to AudioUnitRender on macOS, which requires a pre-allocated buffer. Additionally, it was using the hardware sample rate for input while the output used a different rate, causing sample rate mismatches.\r\n\r\nThis restores the working behavior from Godot 3.6 by:\r\n- Pre-allocating input_buf in init_input_device()\r\n- Using the allocated buffer in input_callback instead of nullptr\r\n- Forcing input sample rate to match output sample rate on macOS\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit: Fixes #35445*","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-16T04:06:44Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T09:55:02Z","closed_at":"2026-01-07T22:16:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b16eaafba72cced92c910c690444b9142d00e8cb","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"graphific:fix-coreaudio-microphone-m1","ref":"fix-coreaudio-microphone-m1","repo":{"id":1097378904,"node_id":"R_kgDOQWisWA","name":"godot","full_name":"graphific/godot","owner":{"login":"graphific"